#CHLOEAI:1
TYPE="path_rules"
GLOB="tests/**"

TEST_COMMAND:
- php artisan test (wraps PHPUnit)
- ./vendor/bin/pest (if using Pest)
- php artisan test --coverage for coverage

TEST_CONVENTIONS:
- Feature tests: tests/Feature/ — hit real routes via $this->get() etc.
- Unit tests: tests/Unit/ — isolated, no framework boot
- Pest: describe() + it() for readable specs
- RefreshDatabase or DatabaseTransactions trait for DB isolation
- Factories for test data (Laravel factories)

COVERAGE_REQUIREMENTS:
- (fill in — e.g., "no hard threshold; coverage reported via Xdebug in CI")

FORBIDDEN_IN_TESTS:
- No real external HTTP calls — use Http::fake()
- No real queue dispatch in unit tests — use Queue::fake()
- No skipped tests without a comment and tracking issue
